No licence has been chosen for this project yet.

This is a template repository (`scaffold-astro-site`), not a finished
project. A project created from it with `gh repo create --template` inherits
this file as-is, and picking a real licence is one of the first things to do
before that project's code goes anywhere another person can see it — before
that, nothing in it may be used, copied, modified or redistributed under any
licence at all.

https://choosealicense.com is a reasonable place to start. Once a licence is
chosen, replace this file with its full text and update the "Licence"
section of README.md to name it.
